1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,015
This is Francis Kelly live from Collins Street with an update on the annual St. Patrick's Day parade.

2
00:00:06,545 --> 00:00:12,655
Right now I can see the first floats of the parade proceeding down Collins Street between George and Pitt Street.

3
00:00:13,515 --> 00:00:17,795
The warm and sunny conditions today have drawn out the crowds in record numbers.

4
00:00:18,515 --> 00:00:21,815
Police have estimated the crowd to be more than 100,000.

5
00:00:22,455 --> 00:00:28,615
Police have warned that anyone coming to the parade should not approach via either George or Pitt Streets.

6
00:00:29,535 --> 00:00:34,995
These roads are now completely blocked, and the police are no longer letting anybody pass the barriers.

7
00:00:35,675 --> 00:00:42,920
Police advise that any spectators arriving now should proceed towards Federation Square, which is not yet completely filled.
